# Invariant

* `docker/docker-compose.yml` includes `../reports:/app/reports` under `dashboard.volumes`.
* `/api/ssot/snapshot/latest` returns `{status: "ok", data.file != null}`.
* `/api/ssot/watchdog/log` returns `{status: "ok"}`.
